Template: bdwn/backup-server
Type: string
Default: dagobah
Description: Backup server host alias
 Name used for the Host entry in the bdwn SSH config and for the
 /etc/hosts line pointing to the backup server.

Template: bdwn/backup-server-ip
Type: string
Default: 192.168.7.104
Description: Backup server IP address
 Address written to /etc/hosts for the backup server host alias.

Template: bdwn/backup-server-port
Type: string
Default: 14789
Description: Backup server SSH port
 Port used for the SFTP connection to the backup server.
